OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will be
OL,6,Fwidespread and heavy at times this
OL,7,Fevening. This gradually clearing east
OL,8,Fovernight with just a few light
OL,9,Fshowers following into the west where
OL,10,Fit will stay cloudy. Some clearer
OL,11,Fspells developing in the east.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA bright but rather breezy
OL,14,Fday with a few sunny spells in the
OL,15,Feast. Cloudier in the west with
OL,16,Fscattered showers and a few brighter
OL,17,Fspells. Feeling rather chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
