OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,6,Fchangeable period with showers or
OL,7,Flonger spells of rain, particularly on
OL,8,FWednesday where showers may be heavy
OL,9,Fat times. Staying quite cool for the
OL,10,Ftime of year.
